  "title": "Integra Reports Voting Results of Annual General Meeting of Shareholders - Integra Resources",
  "summary": "Vancouver, British Columbia – Integra Resources Corp. (“Integra” or the “Company”) (TSXV: ITR; NYSE American: ITRG) is pleased to report the voting results from its Annual General Meeting of Shareholders held on June 26, 2026 (the “AGM”). A total of 71,899,370 shares has been voted, representing 35.55% of the Company’s outstanding shares. The matters voted as part of the AGM […]",
